Description: the sentences of ParaView's 3D options in pt_BR, and the edition's two labels and one
 message in the eight other languages (gettext domain paraview-stereo)
 "Enable 3D" and "3D display settings..." are KiCad's (row 50d) and Jmol's (rows 50e, 46j) words, exactly;
 "The display settings could not be opened." is Jmol's. The translations lane adds the other eight
 languages of the remaining sentences.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-21
